      "searchCoverage": "Official CircleCI API v2 (Circle-Token header, GET /api/v2/me, GET /api/v2/project/{project-slug}, GET /api/v2/project/{project-slug}/pipeline, GET /api/v2/pipeline/{id}, GET /api/v2/pipeline/{id}/workflow), San Francisco operator identity, and dated incident search (CircleCI + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. January 2023 production incident exfiltrated customer environment variables, tokens, and encryption keys after malware stole a 2FA-backed SSO session from an engineer laptop; CircleCI published a 13 January 2023 incident report, rotated tokens, and asked customers to rotate secrets. No current unresolved CircleCI customer API-key compromise of circleci.com is asserted.",
