      "incident": "On 4 January 2023 CircleCI disclosed a security incident. Malware on an engineer laptop stole a valid 2FA-backed SSO session on 16 December 2022. The actor accessed production systems and exfiltrated customer environment variables, tokens, and keys; encryption keys were extracted from a running process. Last unauthorized production activity was recorded 22 December 2022. Several customers later reported unauthorized third-party access using stolen secrets.",
